# Cloudflare Pages — The Urban Physio
# Format: one rule per line — [source] [destination] [code]
#
# DO NOT add "/* /index.html 200" here.
# Cloudflare Pages already SPA-falls back to index.html when no matching file
# (and no custom 404.html) exists. An explicit /* rewrite has poisoned hashed
# asset URLs in the past (HTML cached as .js → Unexpected token '<').
#
# www → apex: set in Cloudflare Dashboard → Rules → Redirects.
#
# /backend/api: frontend uses VITE_API_URL (Hostinger), not a CF proxy.
